    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nMABOTUWANA SRI PIYARATHANA NAYAKA THERO SUWASEVANA FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Mabotuwana Sri Piyarathana Nayaka Thero Suwasevana Foundation\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKATO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n[Bill No. 11]\n\nPresented by Hon. Dayasiri Jayasekara, Attorney at Law, M.P. for Kurunegala Distritct on 08th of May, 2025\n\n(Published in the Gazette on April 10, 2025)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nMabotuwana Sri Piyarathana Nayaka Thero Suwasevana Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n1\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2 - PL 15224 - 230 (05/2025)\n\n10\n\nAn Act to incorporate the Mabotuwana Sri Piyarathana Nayaka Thero Suwasevana Foundation\n\nWHEREAS an Foundation called and known as the \u201cMabotuwana Sri Piyarathana Nayaka Thero Suwasevana Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objects and transacting all matters connected with the said Trust according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said foundation has heretofore successfully carried out and transacted several objects and matters for which it was established, and has applied to be incorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Mabotuwana Sri Piyarathana Nayaka Thero Suwasevana Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2025."
  },
