    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPart II of April 04, 2025\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 08.04.2025)\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nONLINE SAFETY (REPEAL)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nto repeal the Online Safety Act, No. 9 of 2024\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Ravi Karunanayake, M.P.\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nOnline Safety (Repeal)1\n\n5\n\n2 - PL 15187 - 285 (04/2025)\n\n10\n\nAN ACT TO REPEAL THE ONLINE SAFETY ACT, NO. 9 OF 2024\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Online Safety (Repeal) Act, No. of 2025.\n\n2. The Online Safety Act, No. 9 of 2024 is hereby repealed.\n\n3. Any regulations made under the Online Safety Act, No. 9 of 2024, after its enactment, shall be repealed from the date of enactment of this Act.\n\n4. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title\n\nRepeal of the Online Safety Act\n\nSinhala text to prevail in case of inconsistency\n\nRepeal of the Regulations under Online Safety Act\n\n2Online Safety (Repeal)\n\nPrinted at the Department of Government Printing"
