    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPart II of March 21, 2025\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 27.03.2025)\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPERSONAL DATA PROTECTION (AMENDMENT)\n\nABILL\n\nto amend the Personal Data Protection Act, No. 9 of 2022\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Digital Economy\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 1 of the Personal Data Protection Act, No.9 of 2022 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section as amended is to provide for -\n\n(a) all other provisions of the principal enactment except section 1 to come into operation on such date or dates as the Minister may appoint by Order published in the Gazette; and\n\n(b) anything duly done under Parts V, VI, VIII, IX and X of the principal enactment which have already been brought into operation by Orders made under the repealed subsection (3) of section 1 of the principal enactment, to be valid and continue to be in force.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 12 of the principal enactment by the repeal of subsection (2) of that section and is consequential to the amendment made by clause 11.\n\nClause 4 : This clause amends section 17 of the principal enactment and the legal effect of this section as amended is to provide for-\n\n(a) the procedure to be followed in relation to a request received by a controller from a data subject under section 13, 14, 15, 16 or 18 of the principal enactment; and\n\n(b) such request to be complied with by the controller free of charge, except in certain circumstances."
