    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC\n\nSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF\n\nSRI LANKA\n\nINLAND REVENUE (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nTo amend the Inland Revenue Act, No. 24 of 2017\n\nPresented by the Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development on 01st of March, 2025\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 21, 2025)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 84.00\u0003Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n[Bill No. 4]\n\n1Inland Revenue (Amendment)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 150 of the Inland Revenue Act, No.24 of 2017 KHUHLQDIWHU\u0003UHIHUUHG\u0003WR\u0003DV\u0003WKH\u0003\u00b3SULQFLSDO\u0003HQDFWPHQW\u00b4 \u0003DQG\u0003WKH\u0003OHJDO\u0003H\u0d75HFW\u0003RI\u0003WKDW\u0003VHFWLRQ\u0003as amended is to reduce the time period within which a refund may be requested by a tax payer, from four years to two and a half years.\n\nClause 3: This clause amends the First Schedule of the principal enactment and the OHJDO\u0003H\u0d75HFW\u0003RI\u0003WKDW\u00036FKHGXOH\u0003DV\u0003DPHQGHG\u0003LV\u0003WR\u0003LQFUHDVH\u0003WKH\u0003WD[\u0010IUHH\u0003WKUHVKROG\u0003DSSOLFDEOH\u0003IRU\u00033HUVRQDO\u0003,QFRPH\u00037D[\u0003DQG\u0003UHYLVH\u0003WD[\u0003UDWHV\u0003IRU\u0003FHUWDLQ\u0003JDLQV\u0003DQG\u0003SUR\u00bfWV\u0003HDUQHG\u0003E\\\u0003individuals and companies.\n\nClause 4: This clause amends the Third Schedule of the principal enactment and the OHJDO\u0003H\u0d75HFW\u0003RI\u0003WKDW\u00036FKHGXOH\u0003DV\u0003DPHQGHG\u0003LV\u0003WR\u0003H[FOXGH\u0003JDLQV\u0003DQG\u0003SUR\u00bfWV\u0003GHULYHG\u0003IURP\u0003UHQGHULQJ\u0003FHUWDLQ\u0003VHUYLFHV\u0003IURP\u0003WKH\u0003H[HPSWLRQV\u0003JUDQWHG\u0003XQGHU\u0003WKDW\u00036FKHGXOH\u0003ZLWK\u0003H\u0d75HFW\u0003from April 1, 2025.\n\nClause 5: This clause amends the Fifth Schedule of the principal enactment and is consequential to the amendment made by clause 3.\n\n\u0014Inland Revenue (Amendment)\n\n/\u0011'\u0011\u00102\u0011\u0003\u001b\u0015\u0012\u0015\u0013\u0015\u0017\n\n$\u0d87\u0003$\u0d7c\u0d8d\u00037\u0d88\u0003$\u0d86\u0d7e\u0d87\u0d7d\u00037\u0d81\u0d7e\u0003,\u0d87\u0d85\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7d\u00035\u0d7e\u0d8f\u0d7e\u0d87\u0d8e\u0d7e\u0003$\u0d7c\u0d8d\u000f1\u0d88\u0011\u0003\u0015\u0017\u00032\u0d7f\u0003\u0015\u0013\u0014\u001a\n\n%(\u0003LW\u0003HQDFWHG\u0003E\\\u0003WKH\u00033DUOLDPHQW\u0003RI\u0003WKH\u0003'HPRFUDWLF\u00036RFLDOLVW\u00035HSXEOLF\u0003RI\u00036UL\u0003/DQND\u0003DV\u0003IROORZV \u0003\u0010\n\n\u0003 \u0014\u0011\u0003 \u0014 \u0003 7KLV\u0003 $FW\u0003 PD\\\u0003 EH\u0003 FLWHG\u0003 DV\u0003 WKH\u0003 ,QODQG\u0003 5HYHQXH\u0003 $PHQGPHQW \u0003$FW\u000f\u00031R\u0011\u0003\u0003\u0003RI\u0003\u0015\u0013\u0015\u0018\u0011\n\n\u0003 \u0015 \u00037KH\u0003SURYLVLRQV\u0003RI\u0003WKLV\u0003$FW\u0003VKDOO\u0003FRPH\u0003LQWR\u0003RSHUDWLRQ\u0003RQ\u0003$SULO\u0003\u0014\u000f\u0003\u0015\u0013\u0015\u0018\u0011"
